924\u094d\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0941\u0938\u091c\u094d\u091c\u093f\u0924 \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u092f\u0939 <strong>\u091c\u092f\u092a\u0941\u0930</strong> \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\u270d\ufe0f \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u0939\u0948 &ndash; <strong>(A)-(ii), (B)-(i), (C)-(iv), (D)-(iii)</strong></p>", "hasMultipleAnswers": false, "type": "multiple_choice", "isAttempted": true, "isPartiallyCorrect": false, "isCorrect": false, "isGraceMarked": false, "isReevaluated": false, "isBookmark": false, "studentQuestionId": "6ac94c161532265c839bfb4a", "marks": {"positive": 0, "negative": 0.66}, "timeTaken": 9000, "markForReview": false, "isGpscType": false, "isSurrendered": false, "difficultyLevel": null}]}